      "findings": "The repeat key defaults to 0; the bare key assigns -1. When the character counter runs past the source text, PGF stops at 0 or decrements the repeat value and resets the character counter to 1. Thus a positive value is an additional-copy count and a negative value continues until the path state cannot advance."
